# REDE
Ver IP|ip addr show
Ver WiFi|nmcli device status
Ver conexões WiFi|nmcli connection show
Testar internet|ping -c 4 8.8.8.8
Portas abertas|ss -tlnp
Logs do WiFi|journalctl -u NetworkManager -n 100
Logs do WiFi em tempo real|journalctl -u NetworkManager -f
Reiniciar rede|sudo systemctl restart NetworkManager
